**Interceptor: `repo/web/src/connect.ts` (the `authInterceptor` at line 156, with token state in `repo/web/src/auth-state.ts`); Tokens: short-lived JWT access tokens sent as `Authorization: Bearer`, plus an HTTP-only refresh-token cookie (and Personal Access Tokens for programmatic clients); Backend: `repo/server/auth/`**

The interceptor attaches a token to every outgoing request and handles 401s reactively:

```156:178:repo/web/src/connect.ts
